---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<BaseLayout title="Overview" description="AquaSense is a conceptual, cell-free biosensor designed to make heavy-metal water screening clear, portable, and actionable.">
  <section class="home-hero">
    <div class="hero-copy" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Conceptual synthetic biology platform</p>
      <h1>See what<br />water carries.</h1>
      <p class="hero-lead">AquaSense explores a cell-free, color-changing test for preliminary heavy-metal screening—designed around the people who need to understand the result.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button primary" href={`${base}project/`}>Explore the design</a>
        <a class="text-link" href="#how-it-works">How it works</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-visual" role="img" aria-label="Illustration of the AquaSense water sensing cartridge">
      <div class="orbit orbit-one"></div>
      <div class="orbit orbit-two"></div>
      <div class="particle particle-a"></div>
      <div class="particle particle-b"></div>
      <div class="sensor-card">
        <div class="sensor-top"><span>AS—01</span><span>Concept</span></div>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 280 350" role="img" aria-labelledby="sensor-title sensor-desc">
          <title id="sensor-title">AquaSense sample cartridge</title>
          <desc id="sensor-desc">A water droplet enters a circular reaction window and produces a teal signal.</desc>
          <defs>
            <linearGradient id="drop" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#76eadc"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#159b92"/></linearGradient>
            <filter id="soft"><feGaussianBlur stdDeviation="9"/></filter>
          </defs>
          <circle cx="140" cy="162" r="94" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".2"/>
          <circle cx="140" cy="162" r="70" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".25" stroke-dasharray="4 8"/>
          <circle cx="140" cy="162" r="48" fill="#39c5b7" opacity=".2" filter="url(#soft)"/>
          <path d="M140 83c-19 30-44 55-44 82a44 44 0 0 0 88 0c0-27-25-52-44-82Z" fill="url(#drop)"/>
          <path d="M117 167c2 14 10 24 24 27" fill="none" stroke="white" stroke-width="7" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".75"/>
          <path d="M78 280h124" stroke="currentColor" stroke-opacity=".25"/>
          <circle cx="98" cy="306" r="7" fill="#d8ec78"/><path d="M116 306h72" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="5" stroke-linecap="round" opacity=".6"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="sensor-bottom"><span>Signal ready</span><b>Low range</b></div>
      </div>
      <div class="floating-label label-one"><i></i><span>Cell-free<br /><b>reaction</b></span></div>
      <div class="floating-label label-two"><span>Readable in<br /><b>one glance</b></span><i></i></div>
    </div>

    <div class="scroll-cue" aria-hidden="true"><span>Scroll to follow the sample</span><i></i></div>
  </section>

  <section class="manifesto">
    <div class="section-shell split align-start">
      <div data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">The design question</p>
        <h2>What if a water test explained itself?</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="copy-block" data-reveal>
        <p class="lead">Laboratory analysis is essential, but preliminary screening can still be difficult to access, transport, and interpret. AquaSense begins at that gap.</p>
        <p>Our concept combines a freeze-dried, cell-free sensing reaction with a simple visual scale and a closed cartridge. The goal is not to replace certified analysis. It is to help communities decide when and where follow-up testing is most urgent.</p>
        <a class="text-link" href={`${base}human-practices/`}>See how feedback shaped the brief</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="stats-band" aria-label="Key project targets">
    <div class="section-shell stat-grid" data-reveal>
      <div class="stat"><strong>&lt;30</strong><span>minute concept readout target</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>3</strong><span>plain-language signal bands</span></div>
      <div class="stat"><strong>0</strong><span>living cells released from the cartridge</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="how-it-works" class="section-shell">
    <div class="section-heading" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">From sample to signal</p>
      <h2>Five deliberate steps.</h2>
      <p>The interaction is short; the design decisions behind it are not. Each step reduces ambiguity for the person collecting the sample.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="process" data-reveal>
      <div class="process-step"><span class="step-no">01</span><h3>Collect</h3><p>Fill the marked dropper from the water source.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><span class="step-no">02</span><h3>Release</h3><p>Add the sample to a sealed, single-use cartridge.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><span class="step-no">03</span><h3>Recognize</h3><p>A metal-responsive regulator interacts with the target in a cell-free reaction.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><span class="step-no">04</span><h3>Translate</h3><p>The circuit converts molecular recognition into a visible color response.</p></div>
      <div class="process-step"><span class="step-no">05</span><h3>Decide</h3><p>Compare against the printed guide and identify the appropriate next step.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="simulator-band">
    <div class="section-shell split">
      <div class="copy-block" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Interactive concept demo</p>
        <h2>A signal designed to be read—not decoded.</h2>
        <p class="lead">Move the slider to explore how a semi-quantitative result could be communicated.</p>
        <p>This interface is an illustrative design prototype, not a calibrated model. A real device would require analytical validation, interference testing, shelf-life studies, and regulatory review.</p>
        <div class="range-label"><label for="concentration">Illustrative concentration</label><output id="concentration-output" for="concentration">10 µg/L</output></div>
        <input id="concentration" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="10" step="1" />
        <div class="range-scale" aria-hidden="true"><span>0</span><span>50</span><span>100 µg/L</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="strip-demo" data-reveal aria-live="polite">
        <div class="strip-meta"><span>AquaSense / Pb</span><span>Sample 014</span></div>
        <div class="test-window"><i id="signal-disc"></i><span>Reaction window</span></div>
        <div class="result-readout">
          <span class="mono">Screening result</span>
          <strong id="result-label">Follow up</strong>
          <p id="result-action">Confirm with a certified laboratory before making a water-safety decision.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="signal-key"><span><i class="key-low"></i>Low</span><span><i class="key-review"></i>Review</span><span><i class="key-high"></i>High</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell">
    <div class="section-heading" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Explore the documentation</p>
      <h2>One story, many lenses.</h2>
      <p>A content system built to let technical and non-technical readers enter the project from different directions.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <a class="card project-card" href={`${base}project/`} data-reveal><span class="card-index">01</span><h3>Project design</h3><p>Understand the sensing architecture, use case, and containment strategy.</p><span class="text-link">Open chapter</span></a>
      <a class="card project-card lime" href={`${base}engineering/`} data-reveal><span class="card-index">02</span><h3>Engineering</h3><p>Follow three design–build–test–learn cycles and the decisions between them.</p><span class="text-link">Open chapter</span></a>
      <a class="card project-card accent" href={`${base}results/`} data-reveal><span class="card-index">03</span><h3>Results</h3><p>Explore accessible charts, constraints, and the illustrative validation plan.</p><span class="text-link">Open chapter</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-shell">
    <div class="callout" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">Responsible by design</p>
      <h2>The clearest result is one that includes its limits.</h2>
      <p>Every result page distinguishes design targets, illustrative data, and evidence that would still be needed. Transparency is part of the interface.</p>
      <a class="button soft" href={`${base}results/`}>Review the evidence model</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <script>
    const slider = document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#concentration');
    const output = document.querySelector<HTMLOutputElement>('#concentration-output');
    const disc = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#signal-disc');
    const label = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#result-label');
    const action = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#result-action');

    const renderSignal = () => {
      if (!slider || !output || !disc || !label || !action) return;
      const value = Number(slider.value);
      output.value = `${value} µg/L`;
      const lightness = Math.max(33, 77 - value * .38);
      const saturation = 40 + value * .45;
      disc.style.background = `hsl(8 ${saturation}% ${lightness}%)`;
      disc.style.boxShadow = `0 0 ${18 + value / 2}px hsl(8 ${saturation}% ${lightness}% / .35)`;
      if (value < 8) {
        label.textContent = 'Low signal';
        action.textContent = 'Record the result and continue routine monitoring.';
      } else if (value < 30) {
        label.textContent = 'Follow up';
        action.textContent = 'Confirm with a certified laboratory before making a water-safety decision.';
      } else {
        label.textContent = 'Priority follow-up';
        action.textContent = 'Prioritize confirmatory testing and follow local public-health guidance.';
      }
    };
    slider?.addEventListener('input', renderSignal);
    renderSignal();
  </script>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .home-hero { position: relative; width: min(calc(100% - 2rem), 1400px); min-height: calc(100svh - var(--header-h)); margin: auto; display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, .95fr) minmax(400px, .8fr); gap: 2rem; align-items: center; padding: 5rem max(0rem, calc((1400px - var(--max)) / 2)) 6rem; }
  .home-hero::before { content: ''; position: absolute; width: min(52vw, 760px); aspect-ratio: 1; right: -8%; top: 45%; translate: 0 -50%; background: var(--aqua-pale); border-radius: 50%; z-index: -1; }
  .hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .hero-copy h1 { margin: .35rem 0 1.5rem; font-size: clamp(4.6rem, 9.8vw, 9.3rem); }
  .hero-lead { max-width: 650px; color: var(--ink-soft); font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.7vw, 1.35rem); }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
  .hero-visual { position: relative; min-height: 660px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--ink); }
  .sensor-card { position: relative; z-index: 3; width: min(330px, 68vw); padding: 1rem; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--paper-raised) 88%, transparent); backdrop-filter: blur(12px); border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--line) 60%, transparent); border-radius: 2.2rem; box-shadow: 0 35px 70px rgba(6,47,53,.18); rotate: 4deg; animation: float 6s ease-in-out infinite; }
  .sensor-top, .sensor-bottom { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font: 500 .65rem 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .sensor-bottom { padding: .75rem; border-radius: .8rem; background: var(--aqua-pale); }
  .sensor-bottom b { color: var(--aqua-deep); }
  .sensor-card svg { width: 100%; }
  .orbit { position: absolute; aspect-ratio: 1; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 50%; }
  .orbit-one { width: 560px; animation: orbit 25s linear infinite; }
  .orbit-two { width: 430px; border-style: dashed; animation: orbit 18s linear infinite reverse; }
  .particle { position: absolute; z-index: 2; border-radius: 50%; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
  .particle-a { width: 70px; height: 70px; top: 17%; right: 5%; background: var(--lime); }
  .particle-b { width: 32px; height: 32px; bottom: 15%; left: 10%; background: var(--coral); }
  .floating-label { position: absolute; z-index: 5; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .7rem; padding: .7rem .9rem; background: var(--paper-raised); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: .8rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow); font-size: .72rem; line-height: 1.25; }
  .floating-label i { width: 9px; height: 9px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--aqua); box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--aqua-pale); }
  .label-one { left: 0; top: 25%; }
  .label-two { right: -2%; bottom: 22%; }
  .scroll-cue { position: absolute; left: 0; bottom: 1.25rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; color: var(--ink-soft); font: 500 .6rem 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .scroll-cue i { width: 70px; height: 1px; background: var(--line); }
  .manifesto { background: var(--paper-raised); border-block: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .stats-band .section-shell { padding-block: 4rem; }
  .simulator-band { background: var(--navy); color: #edf9f5; }
  .simulator-band .copy-block p { color: #b8d4d0; }
  .simulator-band .copy-block .lead { color: #edf9f5; }
  .simulator-band .eyebrow { color: var(--aqua); }
  .range-label { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .range-label output { color: var(--lime); font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace; }
  input[type='range'] { width: 100%; height: 4px; margin: 1.5rem 0 .3rem; appearance: none; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--aqua), var(--lime), var(--coral)); border-radius: 999px; }
  input[type='range']::-webkit-slider-thumb { appearance: none; width: 24px; height: 24px; background: #fff; border: 5px solid var(--aqua-deep); border-radius: 50%; cursor: grab; }
  input[type='range']::-moz-range-thumb { width: 15px; height: 15px; background: #fff; border: 5px solid var(--aqua-deep); border-radius: 50%; cursor: grab; }
  .range-scale { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; color: #86aba8; font: .65rem 'DM Mono', monospace; }
  .strip-demo { width: min(100%, 480px); justify-self: end; padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem); background: #f8f3e8; color: #062f35; border-radius: 2rem; rotate: 1.5deg; box-shadow: 0 35px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.15); }
  .strip-meta, .signal-key { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 1rem; font: 500 .62rem 'DM Mono', monospace; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .test-window { min-height: 260px; display: grid; place-items: center; align-content: center; gap: 1.2rem; border-bottom: 1px solid #bdcbc4; }
  .test-window > i { width: 112px; height: 112px; border: 14px solid white; outline: 1px solid #bdcbc4; border-radius: 50%; transition: background .2s, box-shadow .2s; }
  .test-window span { color: #52706e; font: .62rem 'DM Mono', monospace; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .08em; }
  .result-readout { padding: 1.5rem 0; }
  .result-readout strong { display: block; margin: .35rem 0; font-size: 2rem; line-height: 1.1; }
  .result-readout p { margin: 0; color: #52706e; font-size: .82rem; }
  .signal-key { padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid #bdcbc4; }
  .signal-key span { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .35rem; }
  .signal-key i { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; }
  .key-low { background: var(--aqua); } .key-review { background: var(--lime); } .key-high { background: var(--coral); }
  .project-card { display: block; color: inherit; text-decoration: none; }
  .project-card .text-link { margin-top: 1rem; }
  @keyframes float { 50% { translate: 0 -12px; rotate: 1deg; } }
  @keyframes orbit { to { rotate: 360deg; } }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .home-hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 5rem; }
    .hero-visual { min-height: 560px; }
    .home-hero::before { width: 90vw; top: auto; bottom: 1%; }
    .scroll-cue { display: none; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .home-hero { width: calc(100% - 1.25rem); padding-bottom: 3rem; }
    .hero-copy h1 { font-size: clamp(4rem, 22vw, 6.5rem); }
    .hero-visual { min-height: 510px; }
    .orbit-one { width: 460px; } .orbit-two { width: 350px; }
    .label-one { left: -3%; top: 18%; } .label-two { right: -3%; bottom: 16%; }
    .floating-label { font-size: .62rem; }
    .strip-demo { box-shadow: 0 22px 0 rgba(0,0,0,.15); }
  }
</style>
